Included from Citadel (Alex's Mobs / Alex's Caves library, copyright AlexModGuy, LGPL-3.0): the server-side classes under
com.github.alexthe666.citadel that Alex's Caves calls, inlined so the mod needs no Citadel jar. The Citadel client, GUI,
book and resource parts are not included.

Changes by the Diaithir project (2026): API port to Minecraft 26.1.2 (unobfuscated names, data components, ValueInput/ValueOutput,
attachments, payloads, 26.1 datapack formats), removal of mixins, Nuclear Furnace, cave-map items, advanced pathfinding and villager
trades, a new cave-chamber world feature replacing the 3D cave biome source, Diaithiris display names, age gate data.
Textures, models, sounds and lang keys are the original assets under the same licence.
The listed changes are marked in git history of this repository. The jar suffix -diaithir.1 marks this modified version.
